    ("Under the Information Technology Act, 2000, which Section grants legal validity and recognition to Electronic Records?", "Section 4", ["Section 66A", "Section 43", "Section 79"], "Section 4 provides that where any law requires information to be in writing or printed form, electronic form fulfills that legal requirement."),
